# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large, fully regenerable data. These live in the project Google Drive.
# Excluded from git because they total ~2 GB and add nothing that cannot be
# rebuilt from the scripts. See README "What is not in this repository".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 810 MB, 23,945 .npy files. Rebuild: 10_SCRIPTS/03_download_intraday.py (resumable)
Datasets/12_CACHE_REGENERATION/

# 1.1 GB of per-year 1-min and 5-min bars.
# Rebuild from the cache: 10_SCRIPTS/05_build_intraday_and_RV.py
Datasets/03_RAW_INTRADAY/

# 17 MB. The pre-cleaning join, kept locally for provenance only - nothing should
# model on it. Rebuild: 10_SCRIPTS/10_build_master_panel.py
Datasets/07_PANEL_INTERMEDIATE/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
